[]\T1/lmtt/m/it/10 Generating subsets in Gray code order can be very fast, beca
use there is a nice recursive construction. Construct a Gray code of $n-1$ elem
ents $G_{n-1}$. Reverse a second copy of $G_{n-1}$ and add $n$ to each subset i
