eneration problems is based on the observation that every subset $S\TS1/lmtt/m/
it/10 '\T1/lmtt/m/it/10 $ is defined by the items of $S$ that are in $S\TS1/lmt
t/m/it/10 '\T1/lmtt/m/it/10 $. We can represent $S\TS1/lmtt/m/it/10 '\T1/lmtt/m
/it/10 $ by a binary string of $n$ bits, where bit $i$ is 1 iff the $i$th eleme
nt of $S$ is in $S\TS1/lmtt/m/it/10 '\T1/lmtt/m/it/10 $. This defines a bijecti
