lmtt/m/it/10 '\T1/lmtt/m/it/10 s dates in sync with the seasons, leap days must
 be added at both regular and irregular intervals. One solar year is 365 days a
nd 5:49:12 hours long, so adding a leap day every four years leaves an extra 10
 minutes and 48 seconds unaccounted for every year. 
