[]\T1/lmtt/m/it/10 The minimum completion time for a DAG can be computed in $O(
n+m)$ time, because it is defined by the critical path. To get such a schedule,
 consider the jobs in topological order, and start each job on a new processor 
the moment its latest prerequisite completes.\index{maze} 
