hether there is a subset of vertices of $H$ whose deletion leaves a subgraph is
omorphic to a smaller graph $G$. For induced subgraph isomorphism, (1) all edge
s of $G$ must be present in $H$, and (2) no non-edges of $G$ can be present in 
