he resulting graph is a DAG, and topological sort (see Section 18.2 (page 546))
 can order the jobs/vertices to respect them. But no such schedule can exist wh
en there are cyclic constraints, such as $A$ before $B$, $B$ before $C$, and $C
$ before $A$. 
