y summing up a geometric series. Furthermore, the height of the hierarchy is $O
(\lg n)$, ensuring fast query times. An alternative algorithm realizing the sam
e time bounds is [EGS86]. The slab method described above is due to [DL76] and 
is presented in [PS85]. Expositions on the inside-outside test for simple polyg
ons include [O\TS1/lmtt/m/it/10 '\T1/lmtt/m/it/10 R01, PS85, SR03]. 
