ells of the arrangement, and further that $O(k)$ total edges form the boundary 
of these cells. This means that we can scan through each edge of every cell we 
encounter on our insertion walk, confident that only linear total work will be 
performed inserting the line into the arrangement. The total time to insert all
 $n$ lines in constructing the full arrangement is thus $O(n^2)$. 
