 with distinct $a$. The best way to test whether a string $s$ is recognized by 
a given regular expression $R$ constructs the finite automaton equivalent to $R
$, and then simulates this machine on $S$. See Section 21.3 (page 685) for alte
rnative approaches to string matching. 
